Matplotlib and PGF
------------------
Figures are drawn with Matplotlib and exported through its PGF backend.
Matplotlib and PGF are separate dependencies; their own licenses apply.
https://matplotlib.org/
https://github.com/pgf-tikz/pgf

Palette
-------
The seven-color default palette derives from the color-blind-safe palette
described by Bang Wong (2011), "Color blindness", Nature Methods 8, 441.
The nonblack colors are reordered and each 8-bit channel is scaled by 0.90
and rounded to an integer. The palette is editable in visual_settings.json.
https://doi.org/10.1038/nmeth.1618
